<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Appendix of Theoretical Analysis ‣ Graph-based Target Back-Propagation for Context Adaptation in Multi-LLM Agentic Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Appendix of Theoretical Analysis ‣ Graph-based Target Back-Propagation for Context Adaptation in Multi-LLM Agentic Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
